  ops/backfill_markout.py:141 `days = reversed(available_days)` = NEWEST FIRST, and
  line 148 `budget -= r['n_written']`: the newest day eats the whole budget, so an older
  day freezes at whatever it reached. Observed: 07-26 stopped being served at 08:19Z on
  07-27 with pending=932 and has not moved since.
  ALSO: n_no_trade does NOT decrement the outer budget -> a systematic empty-window
  condition fires 150 aggTrades (weight 20) PER DAY-DIRECTORY in one run.

