### F5  venue_fills.fill_details_for: cumQuote unreadable -> filled_notional 0.0 ###
  venue_fills.py:123-125   q = float(r.get('cumQuote') or 0.0)
                           ex = float(r.get('executedQty') or 0.0)
                           if q <= 0 and ex <= 0: continue
  A child with executedQty>0 and cumQuote absent PASSES the filter and adds 0.0 to
  `notional`; the symbol is then in `out`, so anchor_loop.py:855 puts it in `filled`
  (NOT in `unknown`, which only covers symbols that could not be REACHED).
  duplicated verbatim at venue_fills.py:171-173 (the retry pass).
  This is the sizing input for top-up. NOT observed in any ledger to date -> LATENT.

